---
layout: base.njk
title: 标签
description: 按主题浏览文章
pageType: tag
pageSubtitle: 把相近的念头放在一起
permalink: /tags/
---
<section id="page" class="page-card tags-page">
  {% if collections.tagList.length == 0 %}
  <div class="empty-posts"><h2>暂无标签</h2><p>写下第一篇文章后，标签会自动出现在这里。</p></div>
  {% else %}
  <div class="tag-cloud-list">{% for tag in collections.tagList %}<a id="{{ tag }}" href="#{{ tag }}" style="font-size: {{ 1.5 + loop.index0 * 0.25 }}em">{{ tag }}</a>{% endfor %}</div>
  <div class="tag-sections">
    {% for tag in collections.tagList %}
    <section><h2>{{ tag }}</h2>{% for post in collections.posts %}{% if tag in post.data.tags %}<a href="{{ post.url | url }}"><span>{{ post.date | dateCN }}</span>{{ post.data.title }}</a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</section>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>
{% include "sidebar.njk" %}
